Package: miQCadj
Title: Extensions and Utilities for miQC-based Cell Filtering
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Eli", "Spies", , "eli.spies@charite.de", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0001-4071-4476"))
Description: Provides extensions for miQC-based single-cell quality
    control, including model component selection using intercept or
    median, posterior-threshold selection, geometry-based plausibility
    checks, and visualization utilities for Seurat and
    SummarizedExperiment- derived workflows.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/ghostlab-id/miQCadj
BugReports: https://github.com/ghostlab-id/miQCadj/issues
